{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ROAR!<br>&quot;DINO SLUG&quot; is an action-packed, lovingly hand-drawn top-down adventure. Explore a dark jungle and fight the lurking soldiers of a totalitarian regime and, of course: dinos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, you\u2019ll find plenty of firearms, grenade types, and helpful items to collect. Arrange them properly in your backpack inventory to unlock surprising new effects that make mercenary life a little easier (or just a lot funnier)!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dino Slug is inspired by classic retro action games from the 80s and 90s.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >hand-drawn cartoon graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >classic 2D single-player experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >tons of weapons and gadgets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >combine your arsenal in the inventory to create exciting and powerful new items!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >lovingly designed levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >numerous enemy types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >precise and simple controls with mouse/keyboard or controller</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a driving soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >multiple boss fights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >destructible environment elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and much, much more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start NOW showing the dinos who\u2019s boss!<br>Over &amp; Out.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4049000?t=1768588307","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049000/e4002b4f9711676675ea1c1ce29aac5456e9a13a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768588307","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049000/c36b9ed194f23a1a312a1a24b30f7f2704d82e29/capsule_23